# Conformance probe pack for the `tlv` wire (spec 0.13). Public. A bare set
# with one-byte tags and two-byte lengths, no key and no checksum. Exercises
# kinds chosen by `when … present`, an empty value, a tag that occurs twice,
# and the shortest long form not used by fixed lengths.
format        conformance-tlv-fixed
version       0.13.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          tlv
tag           1
length        2

field    probe.n      1:4      uint
field    callsign     2        utf8

kind     marked
requires probe.x
when     9            present
field    probe.x      10:1     uint

kind     basic
